Michael here to talk about

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.850
the original content behemoth, Netflix.

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:15.650
Once chiefly a purveyor of
movies in red envelopes,

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.680
Netflix has quickly established itself

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.650
as the film studio of the future,

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:24.650
