00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:37.220
Don't worry, you don't need new glasses.

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:40.710
Netflix does tend to hew
to a unique look and feel.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.390
And, what's more, the Netflix aesthetic

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:45.340
has real implications for
the film medium at large.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.580
We'll explain in this Wisecrack Edition:

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.840
How Netflix is Changing Film.

